Name Buak_Note_46

Interactability_Text_Line_0 2010-7-14
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Today is my 47th birthday, 47.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 7... 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Why does this number haunt me, I don't understand.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 Have I just fixated on it because I began to notice the pattern?
Interactability_Text_Line_6 Is this a sign? Are you trying to tell me I'm on the right track?
Interactability_Text_Line_7 Or are you just haunting me? You can't convince me it's a coincidence.
Interactability_Text_Line_8 You know you didn't need that flower. The cliff incident was your fault.
Interactability_Text_Line_9 I warned you, my sister has been dead for 40 years. Leave me alone until I'm ready.
Interactability_Text_Line_10 If you want to send signs, tell them what happened. Save me the effort.